1|//! Monotonic game-state revision for optimistic concurrency and atomic commands.
2|//!
3|//! Every successful command increments the revision exactly once. Clients capture the current
4|//! revision and send it as the expected revision with their next command; the engine rejects
5|//! stale commands without mutating state. The revision also identifies the exact state version
6|//! for persistence, multiplayer conflict detection, and diagnostic bundles.
